# Localization (English first)

Follow `.cursor/skills/slow-journey-localization/SKILL.md`.

- Put every user-facing label in `lib/l10n/app_en.arb`
- No new hardcoded UI English in widgets
- Do not add a second locale until the user asks
- Run `flutter gen-l10n` after ARB changes
- `flutter analyze` must print **No issues found!**
- `flutter test` must pass
